@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@accessToken = YOUR_BEARER_TOKEN

### Lấy danh sách tất cả thông báo
GET {{baseUrl}}/announcements
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Lấy thông báo theo role
GET {{baseUrl}}/announcements/notifications?role=Learner
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Tạo thông báo mới
POST {{baseUrl}}/announcements
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Test System Maintenance",
  "content": "This is a test maintenance notice.",
  "audience": {
    "scope": "System Wide",
    "roles": [],
    "classes": []
  }
}

### Cập nhật thông báo
PUT {{baseUrl}}/announcements/YOUR_ANNOUNCEMENT_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated System Maintenance",
  "content": "Updated content.",
  "audience": {
    "scope": "System Wide",
    "roles": [],
    "classes": []
  }
}

### Xóa thông báo
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/announcements/YOUR_ANNOUNCEMENT_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
